  "HEAD": "BN254 pairing inversion through the GT discrete logarithm",
  "RETURNS": "returns P in G1 and Q in G2 with e(P, Q) = z",
  "OUTPUT": "Output P in G1 and Q in G2 with e(P, Q) = z; the algorithm recovers x with g^x = z, g = e(P0, Q0) the protected generator, and returns (P0, [x]Q0).",
